+                requestorWs, null, callingUid, Binder.getCallingPid())) {
             mTetheredSoftApTracker.setFailedWhileEnabling();
             return false;
         }
@@ -2233,9 +2238,10 @@ public class WifiServiceImpl extends IWifiManager.Stub {
 
